{"speciesId":514,"names":{"fr":"Flamoutan","es":"Simisear","en":"Simisear","ja":"バオッキー"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il adore les aliments sucrés. Ils lui servent d’énergie pour alimenter le feu à l’intérieur de son corps."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It loves sweets because they become energy for the fire burning inside its body."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Son corps est en combustion. Il projette des flammèches par la tête et la queue pour carboniser ses ennemis."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"A flame burns inside its body. It scatters embers from its head and tail to sear its opponents."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"When it gets excited, embers rise from its head and tail and it gets hot. For some reason, it loves sweets."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"When it gets excited, embers rise from its head and tail and it gets hot. For some reason, it loves sweets."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Son corps est en combustion. Il projette des flammèches par la tête et la queue pour carboniser ses ennemis."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Achicharra a sus enemigos desprendiendo llamas por la cola y la cabeza, fruto de su desmesurado calor interno."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"A flame burns inside its body. It scatters embers from its head and tail to sear its opponents."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"体の 中の 炎を 燃やして 頭や 尻尾から 火の粉を まき散らせて 敵を 焦がす。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Quand il est excité, des flammèches brûlantes dansent sur sa tête et sa queue. Il raffole des choses sucrées."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Cuando se emociona, echa chispas por la cola y la cabeza, y calienta su cuerpo. Por alguna razón le encantan los dulces."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"When it gets excited, embers rise from its head and tail and it gets hot. For some reason, it loves sweets."},{"language":"ja","version":"y